{
  "about": [
    "Every variable a module of the dashboard's browser code keeps at its top level and can change, and whose it is.",
    "every-store-says-whose-it-is.test.mjs finds them in the syntax tree (_stores.mjs) and fails on one this list does not",
    "hold, and on a row for one that is gone. A new store takes a row here, in the pull request that adds it.",
    "",
    "tab           the page's own working: who listens, a timer, code that has arrived, what is under a finger, a count of",
    "              its own. It holds nothing a workspace's read answered and names none of its records.",
    "keyed         one workspace's, kept under the workspace the address names (readCache, heldViews, or a compare of its",
    "              own), so it answers nothing under another's address.",
    "by record     one workspace's, kept under a record's own id or the object it was made from, and only ever asked for by",
    "              that id or object: no other workspace has one, so nothing of it is said there.",
    "emptied       one workspace's, emptied by the switch itself before the address moves.",
    "new document  one workspace's, and right only because a switch of workspace loads the page again. While any row says",
    "              this, a-switch-is-a-new-document.test.mjs must hold; to switch without a load, key or empty each first."
  ],
